      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 15 has effect for the year of assessment 2027. Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 6(1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (r), by substituting for the full stop at the end of the paragraph a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (r) the following paragraph: “(s) income tax shall be charged for each year of assessment upon the income of an individual, who is a partner of a limited liability partnership, which consists of profits derived from Malaysia paid, credited or distributed, whether in cash or in kind, to the individual by the limited liability partnership at the appropriate rate as specified in Part XXIII of Schedule 1.”. Amendment of section 15c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 15C(4A) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “applies, the acquisition price” the words “of the shares”. Amendment of section 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
