        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_v",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_vi"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the proviso to paragraph (c), in paragraph (ca), by substituting for the words “any vaccination” the words “any vaccination of a vaccine registered with the National Pharmaceutical Regulatory Agency”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the proviso to paragraph (g), by substituting for paragraph (d) the following paragraph: “(d) for the purposes of subparagraph (iii), the vaccination which qualifies for deduction shall be vaccines registered with the National Pharmaceutical Regulatory Agency;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (ha), by substituting for the words “limited to a maximum of six thousand ringgit” the words “limited to a maximum of ten thousand ringgit”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (r) the following paragraph: “(r) an amount limited to a maximum of three thousand ringgit expended or deemed to have been expended under subsection (3) in that basis year by the individual on the amount expended for the payment of child care fees to— (i) a child care centre registered under the Child Care Centre Act 1984 [Act 308] or a kindergarten registered under the Education Act 1996 [Act 550] for a child of the individual aged six years and below; or (ii) a care centre registered under the Care Centres Act 1993 [Act 506] for a child of the individual aged twelve years and below: Provided that— (a) where a wife living together with her husband is assessed separately for that year, the deduction under this paragraph shall only be allowed either to the husband or to the wife; (b) the claim is evidenced by a receipt issued by the child care centre, kindergarten or care centre; and (c) the maximum amount of deduction under this paragraph shall apply notwithstanding that the individual may have more than one child;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (s) the following paragraph: “(sa) an amount limited to a maximum of one thousand ringgit expended or deemed to have been expended under subsection (3) in that basis year by the individual as evidenced by a receipt on the amount expended for the payment of entrance fee to a tourist attraction, or for a cultural and arts programme;”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a__subpara_vi",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "vi",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (v) the following “(v) expenses expended in that basis year by the individual— (i) for the payment of installation, rental, purchase including hire-purchase of equipment or subscription for use of electric vehicle charging facility for his own vehicle and not being used for the purposes of his own business for each basis year for the years of assessment 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026 and 2027; (ii) for the purchase of food waste compost machine used for the household purpose of the individual for the years of assessment 2025, 2026 and 2027; (iii) for the payment of installation or for the purchase of food waste grinder machine used for the household purpose of the individual for the years of assessment 2026 and 2027; or (iv) for the payment of installation or for the purchase of closed-circuit television used for the household purpose of the individual for the years of assessment 2026 and 2027;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1A) The expenses referred to in paragraph (1)(v) are subject to the following: (a) the claim is evidenced by a receipt issued in respect of the payment or purchase, as the case may be; (b) the deduction under subparagraph (1)(v)(ii) shall be claimed once either in the year of assessment 2025, 2026 or 2027; (c) the deduction under subparagraphs (1)(v)(iii) and (iv) shall be claimed once either in the year of assessment 2026 or 2027; and (d) the total amount of deduction under this paragraph is subject to a maximum amount of two thousand five hundred ringgit.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by inserting after the words “(s),” the words “(sa),”. Amendment of section 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 49 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3A) A deduction under subsection (1) shall be allowed where an insurance under subsection (3) is contracted for by an individual on the life of the child of the individual.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsections: “(5) A child in this section is a child— (a) under the age of eighteen years and unmarried; (b) who attains the age of eighteen years and above, unmarried and is receiving full-time instruction at any university, college, school or other similar educational establishment; (c) who is unmarried and is serving under articles or indentures with a view to qualifying in a trade or profession; or (d) who is unmarried and physically or mentally disabled in accordance with any written law. (6) For the purposes of this section, a child of an individual or his wife refers to a legitimate child or step-child of his or his wife, or a child adopted by the individual or his wife in accordance with any written law.”. Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 50(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “subsection 49(3),” the words “insurance referred to in subsection 49(3A),”. New section 54c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after the deleted section 54b the following section: “Special treatment on distribution of profits by limited liability partnership 54c. (1) Where in the basis period for a year of assessment, an individual who is a partner of a limited liability partnership has income which consists of profits derived from Malaysia which is paid, credited or distributed, whether in cash or in kind, to the individual by the limited liability partnership in excess of one hundred thousand ringgit, the income is deemed to be the statutory income of the individual for the basis period for that year of assessment. (2) Where the profits under subsection (1) consist of profits in kind, the profits shall be taken to consist of an amount equal to the market value of the profits in kind at the time of the distribution of the profits.”. Amendment of section 65c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_25",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_26",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_27",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_28",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter comes into operation on 1 January 2026. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of “property” the following definition: ‘ “residential property” means a house, condominium, apartment, flat, service apartment or small office home office solely to be used as a dwelling house;’. Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 21(7) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “the Collector” the words “, on an application made within twenty-four months after the date of instrument by the person whom it was first or alone executed,”. New section 80c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 80b the following section: “Power of Collector to utilize excess of duty 80c. (1) Any amount of excess in respect of duty payable which is to be refunded to a person under this Act may be utilized by the Collector for the payment of any other amount of— (a) duty which is due and payable by the person under this Act; or (b) tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by the person under the Income Tax Act 1967, the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169] or the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445]. (2) Where amount of excess in respect of a person is ascertained in accordance with subsection 111(4A) of the Income Tax Act 1967, subsection 50(4) of the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, subsection 24(7A) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 or subsection 12(2) of the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990, the excess shall be applied for the payment of duty which is due and payable by the person under this Act.”. Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The First Schedule to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in relation to item 4, in the column “Description of Instrument”, under “Exemptions”, in paragraph (b), by substituting for the words “RM300 per month” the words “RM3,000 per month”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in relation to item 32—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the column “Description of Instrument”, in paragraph (aa), by substituting for the words “except stock,” the words “except residential property, stock,”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (aa) and the particulars relating to it the following paragraph and particulars: Item Description of Instrument “(ab) On sale of any residential property from 1 January 2026 to a foreign company or a person who is not a citizen and not a permanent resident"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_29__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the column “Proper Stamp Duty”, in subparagraph (e)(i), by inserting after the words “Duty as in (a), (aa),” the words “(ab),”. Amendment of Third Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Third Schedule to the principal Act is amended in item 7, in the column “Person liable to pay Duty”, by substituting for the words “The parties in equal shares” the words “The grantee or transferee”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Finance Act 2025. Amendment of Acts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169], the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445] and the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543] are amended in the manner specified in Chapters II, III, IV, V and VI respectively."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_31",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENT TO THE LABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX ACT 1990 Commencement of amendment to the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "VI",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_33",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENT TO THE PETROLEUM (INCOME TAX) ACT 1967 Commencement of amendment to the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter comes into operation on 1 January 2026. Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 is amended in section 50—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) Any amount of excess in respect of tax payable for a year of assessment which is to be refunded to a person under subsection (1) may be utilized by the Director General for the payment of— (a) any other amount of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by the person under this Act, the Income Tax Act 1967, the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169] or the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445]; or (b) any other amount of duty which is due and payable by the person under the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378].”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (5), by substituting for the words “subsection 111(4A) of the Income Tax Act 1967 or subsection 24(7A) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976” the words “subsection 80 C(1) of the Stamp Act 1949, subsection 111(4 A) of the Income Tax Act 1967, subsection 24(7A) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 or subsection 12(2) of the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter comes into operation on 1 January 2026. Amendment of section 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990 is amended in section 12—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/38/eng@/~chp_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsections: “(2) Any amount of excess in respect of tax payable for a year of assessment which is to be refunded to the Labuan entity under subsection (1) may be utilized by the Director General for the payment of— (a) any other amount of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by the Labuan entity under this Act, the Income Tax Act 1967, the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543] or the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169]; or (b) any other amount of duty which is due and payable by the Labuan entity under the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378]. (3) Where amount of excess in respect of a Labuan entity is ascertained in accordance with subsection 80C(1) of the Stamp Act 1949, subsection 111(4A) of the Income Tax Act 1967, subsection 50(4) of the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 or subsection 24(7A) of the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, the excess shall be applied for the payment of tax which is due and payable (including any amount of instalments which are due and payable) by the Labuan entity under this Act.”."
      }
    }
  ]
}
